@.str.1171 = private unnamed_addr constant [130 x i8] c"Two chemists walk into a bar. The first one says, 'I'll have some H2O.'. The second one says, 'I'll have some H2O, too'. He dies.\00", align 1
@.str.1172 = private unnamed_addr constant [110 x i8] c"There are only two hard things in computer science - cache invalidation, naming things and off-by-one errors.\00", align 1
